---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title='Full Praise Poem'>
  <div
    class='bg-muponda-green py-12 px-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between'
  >
    <div class='mb-4 md:mb-0 text-white'>
      <h1 class='text-2xl md:text-3xl font-serif font-bold'>
        Full Praise Poem
      </h1>
      <p class='text-green-200 text-sm'>Detembo ReNyere</p>
    </div>
    <a
      href='/culture'
      class='px-6 py-2 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white rounded-lg transition border border-white/30 flex items-center'
    >
      <i class='fas fa-arrow-left mr-2'></i> Back to Culture
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class='max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 mt-8 pb-20'>
    <div
      class='bg-white rounded-lg shadow-xl p-8 md:p-12 border-l-8 border-muponda-gold'
    >
      <div class='poem-text space-y-8 text-center md:text-left'>
        <!-- Stanza 1 -->
        <div class='space-y-3'>
          <h3
            class='font-bold text-muponda-green text-xl uppercase tracking-widest border-b pb-2 mb-4'
          >
            Nzvidzi (Nzudzi), Nyere
          </h3>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Mwaita Nyere!
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [Well done Nyere]
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Mwaita Nzvidzi!
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [Well done Serval Cat]
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Stanza 2 -->
        <div class='space-y-3 pt-4'>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Mwaita Samaringa! Wari Nyazongo,
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [Thanks to the visionary ancestors, who are buried at Nyazonga]
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Mwazvita Mapara! Wangopara nhehwe dzichiota!
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [Thanks to our excellent Tanners! Great tanners who tan Leather
              soft]
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Titambire Chikwira chaSaka:
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [Great appreciation! The Hill Palace of King Saka]
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Chingokwirwa ngewakapfugama, Mukamira mashora Dzimbahwe.
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [The Hill Residence only climbed on your knees. Any other posture
              is a sign of disrespect for the King]
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Stanza 3 (Mountains) -->
        <div
          class='space-y-3 pt-4 border-l-4 border-muponda-purple pl-4 md:pl-8 py-2 bg-gray-50 rounded-r-lg'
        >
          <h4 class='text-xs font-sans font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase mb-2'>
            The Sacred Mountains
          </h4>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Hekani wari Rurunji! Gomo reMadzimambo.
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [Greetings to those buried at Mt Ruunji! The Mountain where our
              esteemed Kings are buried]
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Gomo ringokwirwa ngewakaguta!
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [The challenging Mountain scaled only by strong people]
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Wane mwena wangogwesha
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [The weak can only crawl on their bellies]
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Gomo ringobuda mhute!
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [The sacred, mystical Mountain of mist]
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Wari Rurunji kudada, Wangomwa mweru!
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [Proud Ruunji people! Who only drink the best beer/water/milk]
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Stanza 4 (MuDowe) -->
        <div class='space-y-3 pt-4'>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Wazvita hako MuDowe wangu!
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [Well done, my dear MuDowe]
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              MuDowe ungowanikwa ngewatanga
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [For their goodness the Dowe are betrothed to early birds]
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Usina MuDowe ungorira!
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [Without MuDowe livelihoods and prosperity are never assured]
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Stanza 5 (Revered Rulers) -->
        <div class='space-y-3 pt-4'>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Maita Kwerera Samaringa wari Nyazongo
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [Thank you our ancestors/fore-bearers resting at Nyazongo]
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Titambire wari Zeramira! Titambire wari Hwahwazira:
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [Welcome and great appreciation to those interred at Zeramira!
              Thanks to Ancestors at Mt Hwahwazira]
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Gomo remadzishe. Tingotenda wari Manyika!
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [The mountain where our revered rulers rest. Thank you those in
              Manyika]
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Wari Chirowa neChinyauzvare.
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [And those at Chirowa and Chinyauzvare]
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Zvaonekwa Mambo Muponda!
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [Thank you, King Muponda]
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Stanza 6 (King Character) -->
        <div class='space-y-3 pt-4 bg-yellow-50 p-4 rounded-lg'>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Zvaitwa Dzimbahwe! Waridzi weHumambo!
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [Well done Your Majesty! The Royal Family]
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Murambatsvina! Wangopa ngemwoyo wese!
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [Smart King of great generosity]
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Chigumbu chisina unye!
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [And for whom forgiveness is a hallmark]
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Wangochemerwa ngewatanga;
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [First-timers lament for a chance to win you over]
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              SaMuponda: Nyere! Mapara!
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [Great King Muponda of the Serval Cat Clan, acclaimed tanner]
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Hekani Waridzi weDoweguru!
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [Thanks to the revered Ruler Of Doweguru]
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Stanza 7 (Origins) -->
        <div
          class='space-y-3 pt-4 border-l-4 border-muponda-earth pl-4 md:pl-8 py-2'
        >
          <h4 class='text-xs font-sans font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase mb-2'>
            The Origins
          </h4>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Wangotonga Manyika wari kuRwenze!
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [Who graciously presides over Manyika from the Lofty Uplands]
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Wangotondera Matongo wari paMutsamvu weWatsomba
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [For whom Remembrance Ceremonies are done under a big Fig Tree at
              Watsomba]
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Ndo'o pane nhoroondo, asi Dzinde riri Tanganyika!
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [Where our remarkable history is discussed, starting from our
              origins in Tanganyika / Ruvuma]
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Stanza 8 (Regional) -->
        <div class='space-y-3 pt-4'>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Ewo-o wari Rupinda nekwa Mukandi,
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [Welcome rulers at Rupinda and Mukandi]
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Wari Nhunhama, Ruwaka neMagoboza.
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [Those at Nhunhama, Ruwaka and Magoboza]
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Mwaita wari Maringa, Maunga neNyanga,
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [Thanks to those in Maringa, Maunga and Nyanga]
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Zvaonekwa wari Chidazembe, nekwa Chigodora!
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [Those at Chidazembe and Chigodora]
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Stanza 9 (Conclusion) -->
        <div class='space-y-3 pt-4'>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Makayambuka Nzizi Kasambavezi, Gorongoza neRwenya.
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [You crossed these big Rivers: Zambezi; Gorongoza and Rwenya]
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Zvaitwa Nyere! Mwaita Samaringa!
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [Well done, visionary People of repute]
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Waridzi wemasango, Wangoonekwa ngewatanga
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [Whose mastery of stealth and camouflage makes you
              invisible/invincible. And a mystery to many]
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Mwaita; wari Sambawarongo
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [Thanks those buried near the Queen's Pool]
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Zvaonekwa Dzimbahwe: SaMuponda!
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [Well done Your Majesty, King Muponda]
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p
              class='text-gray-900 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Nyere yanguyi-iyi, Zvaitwa Mapara!
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [My precious Serval Cat, to this Clan we proudly belong. Thank you
              Tanners!]
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class='pt-4'>
            <p
              class='text-muponda-green text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold leading-relaxed'
            >
              Tikafira pano ngeyi?
            </p><p class='text-gray-500 italic text-sm md:text-base'>
              [Is this goodness not the reason why we would rather die here?]
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class='mt-12 text-center border-t border-gray-100 pt-8'>
        <a
          href='/culture'
          class='px-8 py-3 bg-muponda-green hover:bg-green-800 text-white rounded-full transition shadow-md'
        >
          <i class='fas fa-arrow-left mr-2'></i> Back to Highlights
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
